    <p>
        The temple of <strong>Shri Sanwaliya Seth</strong> (also written Sanwariya Seth or Sanwaliya Ji) at Mandaphiya is one
        of the most visited Krishna temples in Rajasthan. Devotees from Rajasthan, Gujarat, Madhya Pradesh and beyond come here
        to seek blessings &ndash; and many traders even consider Sanwaliya Seth their business partner. If you are planning a
        darshan, Chittorgarh is the most convenient base, and a taxi is the easiest way to get there.
    </p>

